    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know, i know... but honestly i feel like i'm just overreacting. i had a massive panic attack last month and it felt exactly like this. if i go to the hospital and it's just stress, i'm gonna be so embarrassed and stuck with a huge bill. do you think there's any way i can just try to relax and see if it goes away in an hour? like maybe some breathing exercises or something to calm my nerves down first?",
